Search input layout is misaligned and too small

## Description
The Search Tasks label and search input are displayed on the same line without proper spacing. The input field is too small compared with the rest of the interface.

## Steps to Reproduce
1. Open the Student Task Management System page.
2. Scroll to the Search Tasks section.
3. Observe the search label and input field.

## Expected Result
The search label and input should be neatly aligned, with the input using a suitable width consistent with the task form design.

## Actual Result
The label and input are crowded together, and the search input is very narrow.

## Severity
Low

